---
import MissionLayout from '../../layouts/MissionLayout.astro';
---

<MissionLayout
  slug="boulder-box-saigon"
  heading="Boulder Box Saigon"
  timeline="Aug 2023 – Present"
  status="Live"
  statusHref="https://boulderbox.rocks"
  heroImage="/assets/projects/bbo-image-01.avif"
  explorerGradient="linear-gradient(40deg, #071207 0%, #0d2c1a 100%)"
>
  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">1. The TL;DR <span class="case-section-sub">(Executive Summary)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Purpose</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam&#39;s first boutique bouldering concept &mdash; bringing sport climbing into the urban home and lifestyle space.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Role &amp; Responsibilities</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Founder and CEO. Worked closely with Saigon’s leading route setters and joined the climbing foundation supported by the Sports Authority of Vietnam.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Problem</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam had no accessible, high-quality bouldering facilities and no local business model to reference. Building one from scratch required market education, supply chain problem-solving, and full cultural adaptation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Solution</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">A home-scale boutique bouldering gym designed around community, quality coaching, and a digital-physical growth strategy under the Boulder Box brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Impact</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">300% year-over-year sales growth from launch, 100% PT program retention rate, competitions and events with 150+ participants, and approximately 2,300 unique customers in year three of operations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">2. Strategy &amp; Discovery</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Insight</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam&#39;s fitness market lacked accessible indoor climbing. Positioning as &ldquo;climbing meets lifestyle&rdquo; unlocked a new demographic beyond hardcore sport climbers, making the concept approachable to urban young professionals.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Stakeholders</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Self-led initiative. Coordinated with local contractors, climbing coaches, and community fitness influencers across Ho Chi Minh City.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Constraint</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">No local market data, a near-nonexistent climbing gear supply chain in Vietnam, and no comparable business model to benchmark &mdash; everything had to be built from first principles.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">3. Execution <span class="case-section-sub">(The &ldquo;How&rdquo;)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Key Decision</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Positioned as a home-scale boutique rather than a large competition-style gym. This prioritized intimacy and quality coaching over scale, aligning with the urban lifestyle audience and keeping construction costs manageable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Design Leadership</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Led end-to-end construction design, brand identity, coaching program structure, digital presence (boulderbox.rocks), community events, and business development &mdash; all without a team playbook.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">4. Google Reviews Highlight</h2>
    <p class="case-field-value review-intro">Paraphrased highlights from six public 5-star Google reviews.</p>
    <div class="review-grid">
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">A welcoming climbing community and a memorable place to reconnect with Vietnam’s climbing scene.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Dan Le</p>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">A friendly, intimate gym where the owner and community help visitors feel at home.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Alexandre</p>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">Visitors appreciate the clean space, training equipment, thoughtful routes, and helpful front-desk team.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Shen Jia Wang</p>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">A relaxed, welcoming setting with enjoyable routes and staff who encourage climbers.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Elizabeth Murtaugh</p>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">Climbers highlight technical, challenging problems and room to enjoy an extended session.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Swanny Nguyen</p>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <p class="review-card-rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">5/5 · Google review</p>
        <p class="review-card-summary">A cozy gym with plenty of routes, welcoming staff, and air-conditioning for comfortable sessions.</p>
        <p class="review-card-author">— Milla N.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="review-source"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/CUN1GyF3rDfMctpT7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read reviews on Google Maps ↗</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">5. Visual Highlights</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Gallery</h3>
      <div class="gallery-wrap">
        <div class="gallery-track-wrap">
          <div class="gallery-track" id="galleryTrack">
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-03.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-01.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-02.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-10.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-11.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
            <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-12.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-controls">
          <button class="gallery-btn" id="galleryPrev" aria-label="Previous">&#8592; Back</button>
          <span class="gallery-counter" id="galleryCounter">1 / 6</span>
          <button class="gallery-btn" id="galleryNext" aria-label="Next">Next &#8594;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">6. Outcome &amp; Lessons</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">KPIs</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">300% year-over-year sales growth from launch. 100% PT program retention rate. Competitions and events with 150+ participants. Approximately 2,300 unique customers in year three of operations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Next Steps</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Expand to a second facility, deepen digital community engagement via boulderbox.rocks, and develop a route-setting curriculum for coach training.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MissionLayout>

<style>
  .review-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .review-card {
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    background: rgba(5, 12, 18, 0.65);
  }

  .review-card-rating {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-hi);
  }

  .review-card-summary {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(247, 255, 199, 0.82);
  }

  .review-card-author {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .review-intro { margin-bottom: 18px; }

  .review-source {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
  }

  .review-source a {
    color: var(--accent-hi);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .review-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
